    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tx16](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tx16) Magnitude 6.4 earthquake at 17.0 depth occurred on Nov 09 2026 31km SW of Lata. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -10.8669 longitude 165.5616. It impacted 6165 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
